WEBVTT

00:00:28.694 --> 00:00:31.064
istom tehnikom koja se koristila

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:33.694
u učionicama 14-tog stoljeća.

00:00:33.694 --> 00:00:36.494
Pogledajte, imamo udžbenik

00:00:36.494 --> 00:00:39.438
mudraca na pozornici,

00:00:39.438 --> 00:00:41.337
i spavača u zadnjoj klupi.

00:00:41.337 --> 00:00:42.238
(Smijeh)

00:00:42.238 --> 00:00:45.175
Baš kao i danas.

00:00:45.175 --> 00:00:48.286
Zato smo moj suradnik

00:00:48.286 --> 00:00:49.926
Sebastian Thrun i ja

00:00:49.926 --> 00:00:51.700
pomislili kako mora postojati bolji način.

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:53.354
Postavili smo si izazov

00:00:53.354 --> 00:00:54.645
da kreiramo on-line predavanja

00:00:54.645 --> 00:00:56.276
koja bi po kvaliteti bila jednaka ili bolja

00:00:56.276 --> 00:00:58.612
predavanjima na Stanfordu,

00:00:58.612 --> 00:01:00.822
a bila bi dostupna svima na svijetu